    "features": "<p><strong>AKA:</strong> Drunk, Yob, Bushwhacker</p><p>With several pints of lager in the tank, and raring for a brawl, he hooligan is a destructive force of nature. Unlikely to enter he membership of a criminal gang or anything so formal, a hooligan’s drunkenness and desire to spar play out more often in pubs, dark streets, and the stands of sports matches. n his mind, the hooligan is having a good time, and anyone who disagrees needs their mind changed with his fists.</p><p><strong>Stunts:</strong> Adrenaline Rush, Whatever’s Handy</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Party Animal (Novice), Thrown Weapon Style (Novice)</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> knuckle dusters, makeshift club, heavy leathers (or equivalent)</p>",
